WEBVTT

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:05.870
You evil, frazzling meanie,

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:07.770
I'm gonna teach you a lesson!

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:14.280
Frazzling?

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:15.600
Sh-Shut up!

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.490
You frazzling meanie, 
who are you, anyway?

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:20.760
I'm Miho Ayumu.

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:21.550
Who are you?

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:26.730
Kashimura Sana! Amazing, right?

00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:29.360
Where are we? How did you do this?

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:33.220
Looks like you finally understand 
your situation.

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:36.900
This is Wonderland!

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:39.890
I made this place so I could catch you.

00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:42.770
Everything in this room happens 
the way I want it to.

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:46.650
In here, no one can beat me!

00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:48.650
Is this some kind of magic?

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.150
Magic?

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:51.390
It's nothing like that.

00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:56.560
I'm not letting you leave this place...
 until you apologize... got it?

00:00:57.020 --> 00:00:58.640
C-Crying won't work.

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:00.160
I don't care if you get hungry, either!

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:03.720
And you can't use the bathroom!

00:01:06.940 --> 00:01:09.440
Stay here and think about 
what you've done!

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:13.590
H-Huh?

00:01:14.230 --> 00:01:15.520
Wait a second!

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:51.020
<b>The Little Queen</b>

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:52.770
Let go!

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:54.440
Don't follow me, darn it...

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:55.520
J-Just wait.

00:02:55.770 --> 00:02:58.640
I'll apologize, so please listen to me.

00:02:58.640 --> 00:03:01.380
Huh? I don't care about that.

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:02.470
Now, let go!

00:03:02.470 --> 00:03:04.340
I'll apologize! I'm sorry!

00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:07.000
I've been searching for you for so long!

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:07.580
Huh?

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:12.060
If you know something about that 
weird power, please tell me!

00:03:12.610 --> 00:03:13.420
My...

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:18.610
My most precious friend is forcing 
herself to endure horrible pain!

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:31.580
Wait... Huh?

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:05.190
Ugh, darn it!

00:04:05.190 --> 00:04:07.760
I feel all frazzled!

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:09.130
Darn it all!

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:12.230
I hate feeling frazzled!

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:17.360
Even Yonaga and Asahi were worried 
about that friend of yours!

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:18.640
That's just not right.

00:04:18.640 --> 00:04:20.920
Why do I have to have 
this weird feeling?

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:21.860
It's weird!

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:24.490
U-Uh, listen...

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:25.610
Shut up!

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:28.410
Ugh, now I'm confused again!

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:31.190
Listen, you... I'm angry.

00:04:31.190 --> 00:04:32.760
I'm angry, you hear?

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:34.830
I know. I'll apologize.

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:36.030
I'm sorry.

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:41.170
Ugh... Listen to me!

00:04:41.390 --> 00:04:44.130
Stop saying you apologize!

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:47.770
B-But you told me to.

00:04:47.770 --> 00:04:48.890
What will make you forgi—

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:52.280
Sh-Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:54.220
Shut up! Shut up!

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:58.330
Uh-oh. He's calling.

00:04:59.220 --> 00:05:00.390
Hide for now.

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:03.900
W-Wait.

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:04.920
Be quiet.

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:05.960
Got it?

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:11.820
Hey,

00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:13.330
what is all this?

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:15.600
Where did you put my bathroom?

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:16.740
U-Uh...

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:18.540
Huh? This is a bathroom?

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:27.590
You just looked me in the 
eye and tried to run, didn't you?

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:27.930
I-I was just...

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:30.060
What's going on here? Explain this!

00:05:34.630 --> 00:05:36.270
Huh?!

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:38.350
I'll take your order when you're ready.

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:38.980
Huh?

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:40.690
Thank you!

00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:45.150
Hey!

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:46.630
What?

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:48.110
Hey, you! Over here!

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:50.760
It's me.

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:53.410
Huh? Kashimura-san?

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:54.980
Kashimura-san...

00:05:54.980 --> 00:05:58.230
Kashimura-san, huh? I kinda like that!

00:06:02.070 --> 00:06:04.500
The other day, that girl with you...

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:06.780
The one with the red thing in her hair.

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:08.030
You mean Ha-chan?

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:10.360
Do you like her?

00:06:10.740 --> 00:06:12.880
Why? She's an evil person.

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:16.740
Well... I don't know.

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:17.950
She's my friend.

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:19.680
Your friend?

00:06:19.680 --> 00:06:20.450
Yeah.

00:06:20.450 --> 00:06:21.770
Are you guys close?

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:22.810
Yeah.

00:06:22.810 --> 00:06:25.840
We've been in the same 
class since first grade.

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:26.780
First grade?

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:29.190
Oh, you mean school?

00:06:29.190 --> 00:06:30.740
You go to school?

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:31.500
Yeah.

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:34.500
Wait, you don't go to school?

00:06:35.010 --> 00:06:36.200
No, I don't.

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:38.160
Is school fun?

00:06:38.530 --> 00:06:41.620
Yeah, I don't like studying too much,

00:06:41.620 --> 00:06:44.110
but I get to see my 
friends, so it's fun.

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:46.630
But...

00:06:46.980 --> 00:06:50.260
Even though Ha-chan loved 
school, she stopped coming.

00:06:52.650 --> 00:06:56.980
I hate the idea of never being 
able to play with her again.

00:06:58.120 --> 00:07:01.730
But I don't understand 
anything about magic.

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:06.400
I don't know what to do.

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:08.980
Do you feel frazzled, too?

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:11.630
You said that earlier.

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:13.260
What do you mean by "frazzled"?

00:07:13.260 --> 00:07:15.160
Frazzled means frazzled.

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:18.030
Want some?

00:07:19.610 --> 00:07:21.120
So good...

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:23.920
Maybe even as good as pancakes...

00:07:26.100 --> 00:07:27.510
I swear...

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:30.320
The moment I finish lecturing 
her, she's talking in her sleep.

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:31.700
Grandpa!

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:34.340
The bathroom's so big...

00:07:34.340 --> 00:07:36.090
And so cute.

00:07:36.090 --> 00:07:39.000
Oh, maybe I'll make this my room!

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:43.650
You seem like a good person, 
but that Ha-chan is evil.

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:49.700
Aw, you're so clingy today...

00:07:49.700 --> 00:07:51.200
Just like a baby.

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:54.440
Mom, I'll be with you forever, okay?

00:07:55.930 --> 00:07:57.620
Where's this coming from?

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:59.100
Of course you will.

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:10.450
Mom...

00:08:20.480 --> 00:08:21.770
What is this?

00:08:52.770 --> 00:08:54.840
Where am I?

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:35.780
Those look good!

00:09:35.780 --> 00:09:37.430
Go get Sana.

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:38.890
Sure!

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:41.750
Sana-chan?

00:09:42.190 --> 00:09:44.110
Sana-chan!

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:01.870
Wow!

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:03.680
Look at what's in here—

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:04.360
Ow!

00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:08.180
Sana-chan's gotten pretty clever, huh?

00:10:14.030 --> 00:10:15.170
How cute—

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:16.010
Ow.

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:27.890
<b>Went to catch the evil girl</b>

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:28.900
"Evil girl"?

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:32.460
That's weird.

00:10:32.460 --> 00:10:35.480
It's like a little kid made 
only this part.

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:39.080
So you're Ha-chan...

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:41.840
I'm going to catch you!

00:10:42.670 --> 00:10:44.740
Um, who are you?

00:10:45.760 --> 00:10:46.570
Well?

00:10:46.570 --> 00:10:48.700
Can't tell who I am, can you?

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:50.710
I'm a really scary grown-up.

00:10:50.940 --> 00:10:53.560
I made this whole room!

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:57.090
Right now, you're basically 
in my stomach!

00:10:57.090 --> 00:10:59.260
How about that? Scared, aren't you?

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:00.990
You evil girl!

00:11:02.620 --> 00:11:07.150
You don't have to tell
me I'm evil. I know I am.

00:11:08.550 --> 00:11:10.180
I don't know who you are,

00:11:11.460 --> 00:11:14.330
but you don't scare me at all!

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:16.160
Huh?

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:27.030
That's a lie.

00:11:27.030 --> 00:11:28.980
Because I'm incredible.

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:30.830
I can do anything.

00:11:31.200 --> 00:11:33.460
I could crush you like a bug,

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:36.470
or lock you up in a really scary place!

00:11:36.470 --> 00:11:37.440
And I mean scary!

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:39.110
No bathroom or snacks!

00:11:39.110 --> 00:11:42.580
You're the girl I met in Harajuku 
a while ago, aren't you?

00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:44.110
N-No!

00:11:44.110 --> 00:11:44.840
Liar.

00:11:44.840 --> 00:11:46.300
I-I'm not lying...

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:50.740
I-I'm a really scary grown-up 
that you don't even know.

00:11:50.740 --> 00:11:53.300
Grown-ups don't speak like that.

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:58.800
Also, I can tell right away if you 
lie, no matter what you try.

00:12:04.130 --> 00:12:05.870
You know nothing.

00:12:06.510 --> 00:12:07.920
Did you say something?

00:12:07.920 --> 00:12:09.490
Forget it. I'm leaving.

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:10.910
W-Wait!

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:13.250
Ow! Darn, it's too cramped in here!

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:15.440
Y-You won't get away!

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:17.470
You're trying to run 
because you're evil.

00:12:17.470 --> 00:12:18.880
That's bad, you know!

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:20.800
That's true.

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:24.450
I knew what I was doing when I turned evil.

00:12:24.450 --> 00:12:25.220
Huh?

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:29.440
B-But you're not supposed 
to do bad things.

00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:30.920
You'll get yelled at...

00:12:30.920 --> 00:12:32.980
I know that. That's obvious.

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:37.270
You see, I'm a witch.

00:12:37.620 --> 00:12:39.160
An evil witch, at that.

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:41.660
I'm no longer a normal human.

00:12:42.050 --> 00:12:44.830
No one in this world is on my side.

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:46.070
Th-That's...

00:12:46.670 --> 00:12:52.040
Only one person is left who 
really cares about me.

00:12:52.740 --> 00:12:55.040
I've ruined everything.

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:56.830
U-Uh...

00:12:57.260 --> 00:12:58.960
No need to tell me...

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:01.300
I'm evil.

00:13:04.320 --> 00:13:07.550
There's no way you could 
understand how I feel.

00:13:09.330 --> 00:13:11.390
<i>She really is evil.</i>

00:13:12.190 --> 00:13:16.030
But Ha-chan is still a really good girl.

00:13:17.970 --> 00:13:20.090
Th-That's a lie.

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:22.020
She's an evil person!

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:25.200
She turned everyone all weird, 
including Zoroku...

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:28.800
Ha-chan is always very kind,

00:13:28.800 --> 00:13:31.660
and she's way smarter than I am.

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:32.960
And she's cute.

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:35.910
She's nothing like me at all.

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:40.630
I wish I could've become a witch, too.

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:47.760
Move.

00:13:48.210 --> 00:13:49.090
No.

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:52.470
I have nothing to say to you.

00:13:52.800 --> 00:13:55.380
No... I feel all frazzled.

00:13:55.380 --> 00:13:56.780
Ugh, I don't get it!

00:13:56.780 --> 00:13:58.630
Don't get what? Frazzled?

00:13:58.630 --> 00:14:01.180
Didn't you want to make me pay?

00:14:01.180 --> 00:14:02.880
So hurry up and do it.

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:04.730
Shut up! I don't get it!

00:14:05.100 --> 00:14:06.640
Y-You're both weird.

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:08.550
I know you're evil!

00:14:08.550 --> 00:14:11.000
But when I asked, she said you aren't!

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:11.700
Huh?

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:14.270
And she's a good person...

00:14:14.270 --> 00:14:16.620
She asked me to help you.

00:14:17.170 --> 00:14:18.590
It doesn't make sense!

00:14:18.590 --> 00:14:19.590
Wait.

00:14:19.990 --> 00:14:21.170
Do you mean...

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:24.660
I hate being frazzled all the time!

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:26.420
Who is "she"?

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:32.330
Oh, right... How did you 
know where I live?

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:33.590
Who told you?

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:35.810
No way.

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:37.890
Ayu-chan told you about me?

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:40.780
I... I don't know.

00:14:40.780 --> 00:14:41.860
Don't lie!

00:14:42.180 --> 00:14:44.230
B-But it's a secret.

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:46.650
This is an order!

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:48.610
Did Ayu-chan tell you that?

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:49.810
Answer me!

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:00.080
Why?

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:01.760
What's going on?

00:15:28.290 --> 00:15:30.400
Abnormal situation in Wonderland.

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:32.410
Energy emission increased.

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:34.500
Spatial wave factor rising.

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:36.870
Report of an abnormality 
detected in Hidakamioka.

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:38.660
Quantum entanglement observed.

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:41.320
Jodorowsky space is about to collapse.

00:15:41.320 --> 00:15:42.710
What's going on?

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:44.710
Alert level upgrading to yellow!

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:48.710
What in the world is going on

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:51.140
in Wonderland?

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:01.280
What is this?

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:10.740
A giant Ferris wheel has 
appeared in Kyoto?

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:13.440
Dreams of Alice are appearing everywhere.

00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:15.370
Is it possible to get an actual count?

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:17.920
In such a broad area, it'll take time.

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:18.620
Senpai, Wonderland is expanding!

00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:20.940
The details are still unclear,

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:22.620
<b>Breaking News: Ferris Wheels 
Appearing Throughout Kyoto</b>

00:16:20.940 --> 00:16:22.620
but we've never seen effects like this.

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:29.880
<i>Kashimura-san said she was 
going to Ha-chan's house.</i>

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:31.280
<i>I hope it'll be okay.</i>

00:16:34.120 --> 00:16:35.650
Hello? Mom?

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:38.390
What's up? I'm almost home.

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:41.520
Ha-chan...

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:43.480
She's gone?

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:53.820
Sana-chan still isn't back, huh?

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:12.170
Grandpa?

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:14.170
I'm going out to look around.

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:20.610
Welcome home, Dad.

00:17:20.610 --> 00:17:22.430
Thanks. Is your mom home?

00:17:22.940 --> 00:17:23.910
Not yet.

00:17:24.630 --> 00:17:27.760
Mom's helping Ha-chan's 
mom search for her.

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:28.690
I see.

00:17:32.670 --> 00:17:34.900
I got a call earlier, too.

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:38.120
I'll go out and join your mom.

00:17:40.340 --> 00:17:41.430
Where's Daiki?

00:17:41.430 --> 00:17:43.300
He had dinner and went to bed.

00:17:49.930 --> 00:17:51.690
You eat your dinner, too.

00:17:52.230 --> 00:17:53.480
And go to bed.

00:17:56.980 --> 00:17:57.720
Hey...

00:17:57.720 --> 00:17:58.690
No.

00:17:59.900 --> 00:18:02.000
I know you're worried,

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:05.370
but it's dangerous for a kid to walk 
around outside at this hour.

00:18:06.920 --> 00:18:10.340
It'll be fine. Ha-chan has a good 
head on her shoulders.

00:18:10.340 --> 00:18:11.880
She'll turn up soon.

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:26.330
<b>Ha-chan</b>

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:26.330
<b>No Answer</b>

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:26.330
<b>
Ha-chan? Where are you?</b>

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:26.330
<b>
What's wrong? Are you okay?</b>

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:28.330
<b>Unread</b>

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:34.170
<b>Went to catch the evil girl. 
I'll eat my snack later.</b>

00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:36.420
Who could this evil girl be?

00:18:36.680 --> 00:18:39.700
The research facility isn't 
around anymore...

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:43.330
Grandpa?

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:45.700
Did you find Sana-chan?

00:18:46.880 --> 00:18:49.480
Oh, who knows where 
she wandered off to?

00:18:51.180 --> 00:18:52.440
Sheesh.

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:54.570
Do you think she's okay?

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:57.910
Well, I'm sure she'll come home 
when she gets hungry.

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:02.120
Hello?

00:19:02.880 --> 00:19:04.850
Oh, Ichijo-san?

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:06.280
Perfect timing.

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:08.560
Sana?

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:10.520
No, she isn't here right now.

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:12.220
Then I was right.

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:14.210
<i>What does that mean?</i>

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:16.060
A few hours ago,

00:19:16.060 --> 00:19:18.760
something strange happened 
in Wonderland.

00:19:19.120 --> 00:19:21.090
It's difficult to access at the moment.

00:19:21.090 --> 00:19:23.080
I don't know the details.

00:19:23.670 --> 00:19:26.770
<i>But I believe Sana-chan 
must be trapped there.</i>

00:19:27.900 --> 00:19:32.090
And it appears someone 
else is in there with her.

00:19:32.870 --> 00:19:35.690
I'm on my way there, so if you would—

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:37.070
<i>Okay. I'm going, too.</i>

00:19:37.470 --> 00:19:39.170
<i>No, wait...</i>

00:19:39.170 --> 00:19:41.600
<i>Right now, Wonderland is expanding.</i>

00:19:41.600 --> 00:19:43.040
<i>It's very dangerous!</i>

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:44.900
All the more reason why I should go!

00:19:44.900 --> 00:19:47.370
Those kids are stuck in there.

00:19:47.640 --> 00:19:50.650
Isn't getting them an adult's job?

00:20:16.910 --> 00:20:18.360
S-Someone!

00:20:28.350 --> 00:20:29.950
Isn't anyone there?

00:20:30.350 --> 00:20:31.240
Hey!

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:36.540
I knew it was you.

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:37.850
Sh-Shut up.

00:20:38.220 --> 00:20:40.340
Hey, this won't open.

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:41.880
You want me to open it?

00:20:42.190 --> 00:20:43.410
N-No...

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:46.260
I should only have to think
about it opening for it to open!

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:49.990
I-It's true. It usually works.

00:20:59.950 --> 00:21:04.100
<i>If she asked me to help and I did,</i>

00:21:04.100 --> 00:21:05.200
<i>I wonder what she'd do.</i>

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:12.700
<i>That was easier than I expected.</i>

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:17.020
<i>I know I'm not nearly as 
strong as Ayu-chan.</i>

00:21:17.020 --> 00:21:18.080
<i>Is this girl...</i>

00:21:26.620 --> 00:21:27.600
Hey.

00:21:28.210 --> 00:21:30.010
Where are we?

00:21:30.480 --> 00:21:33.650
Please... I need to get home.

00:21:34.360 --> 00:21:37.070
I get that you're amazing, all right?

00:21:37.070 --> 00:21:38.730
And I will apologize.

00:21:39.050 --> 00:21:41.400
So please send me home.

00:21:42.910 --> 00:21:44.630
Oh, well...

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:46.040
Yeah.

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:52.020
Listen...

00:21:52.590 --> 00:21:54.090
I'm not sure.

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:56.390
But we might...

00:21:57.790 --> 00:22:01.210
not be able... to go home.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
Next Episode 
The Queen and the Witch

00:23:36.110 --> 00:23:37.690
The Queen and the Witch.
